  "releaseNotes": "v2.5.0:\n- New: TypingIndicatorReceived event — IRCv3 +typing client tag via TAGMSG\n- New: TypingState enum (Active, Paused, Done) and TypingIndicatorEvent class\n- Self-typing notifications automatically filtered\n- IIrcClient interface: 6 properties, 37 methods, 34 events\n- Fixed CLIENT_PREFIX doc, added param tags to TypingIndicatorEvent\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/etushar89/IRCDotNet.Core#changelog",
